  "display_title": "No Mercy",
  "description": "I thought I lost everything to my best friend, Valietta, but I didn’t expect I’d lose my husband to her as well. I, Sierra Brilloxen, was too naive to see that her copying me wasn’t affection—it was obsession. I shattered and decided to end it all. But somehow, I was given a second chance—seven years in the past. This time, I won’t let her get rid of me. I’ll take back everything she stole and show her no mercy for the pain she caused.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
